aph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2364","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2364"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Experimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model-specific options for video generation"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"prompt","children":[{"type":"text","value":"prompt"}]},{"type":"code","value":"prompt: MediaPrompt;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2353","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2353"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Experimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description of the desired video: a plain string, or an ordered array of\ncontent parts for image-conditioned generation. Image parts may carry\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"metadata.role"},{"type":"text","value":" ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'start_frame' | 'end_frame' | 'reference' | 'character'"},{"type":"text","value":") to disambiguate intent; adapters route them onto the\nprovider-native request (e.g. OpenAI Sora "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"input_reference"},{"type":"text","value":", fal\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"image_url"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"end_image_url"},{"type":"text","value":") and throw at runtime if unsupported."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"size","children":[{"type":"text","value":"size?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional size?: TSize;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2355","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2355"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Experimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Video size — format depends on the provider (e.g., \"16:9\", \"1280x720\")"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tprovideroptions","text":"TProviderOptions","level":3},{"id":"tsize","text":"TSize","level":3},{"id":"tduration","text":"TDuration","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"abortsignal","text":"abortSignal?","level":3},{"id":"duration","text":"duration?","level":3},{"id":"logger","text":"logger","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"modeloptions","text":"modelOptions?","level":3},{"id":"prompt","text":"prompt","level":3},{"id":"size","text":"size?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2338](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2338)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nOptions for video generation.\nThese are the common options supported across providers.\n\n Video generation is an experimental feature and may change.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `object`\n\n### TSize\n\n`TSize` *extends* `string` \\| `undefined` = `string`\n\n### TDuration\n\n`TDuration` *extends* `string` \\| `number` \\| `undefined` = `number`\n\n## Properties\n\n### abortSignal?\n\n```ts\noptional abortSignal?: AbortSignal;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2375](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2375)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nEffective abort signal composed by the activity from caller `abortSignal`\nand/or `timeout`. Adapters should forward this to the provider SDK when\nsupported. Request-specific — never store on a global client config.\n\n***\n\n### duration?\n\n```ts\noptional duration?: TDuration;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2362](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2362)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nVideo duration. Adapters that declare a per-model duration map narrow\nthis to that model's union (a number, `\"8\"`, or `\"8s\"`). Use\n`adapter.snapDuration(input)` to coerce a raw value. `input` may be\nseconds, a `\"6s\"` template, or `\"auto\"` when the model lists it.\n\n***\n\n### logger\n\n```ts\nlogger: InternalLogger;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2369](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2369)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nInternal logger threaded from the generateVideo() entry point. Adapters must\ncall logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in catch blocks.\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2344](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2344)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nThe model to use for video generation\n\n***\n\n### modelOptions?\n\n```ts\noptional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2364](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2364)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nModel-specific options for video generation\n\n***\n\n### prompt\n\n```ts\nprompt: MediaPrompt;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2353](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2353)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nDescription of the desired video: a plain string, or an ordered array of\ncontent parts for image-conditioned generation. Image parts may carry\n`metadata.role` (`'start_frame' | 'end_frame' | 'reference' |\n'character'`) to disambiguate intent; adapters route them onto the\nprovider-native request (e.g. OpenAI Sora `input_reference`, fal\n`image_url` / `end_image_url`) and throw at runtime if unsupported.\n\n***\n\n### size?\n\n```ts\noptional size?: TSize;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2355](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2355)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nVideo size — format depends on the provider (e.g., \"16:9\", \"1280x720\")\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: VideoGenerationOptions\ntitle: VideoGenerationOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2338](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2338)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nOptions for video generation.\nThese are the common options supported across providers.\n\n Video generation is an experimental feature and may change.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `object`\n\n### TSize\n\n`TSize` *extends* `string` \\| `undefined` = `string`\n\n### TDuration\n\n`TDuration` *extends* `string` \\| `number` \\| `undefined` = `number`\n\n## Properties\n\n### abortSignal?\n\n```ts\noptional abortSignal?: AbortSignal;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2375](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2375)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nEffective abort signal composed by the activity from caller `abortSignal`\nand/or `timeout`. Adapters should forward this to the provider SDK when\nsupported. Request-specific — never store on a global client config.\n\n***\n\n### duration?\n\n```ts\noptional duration?: TDuration;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2362](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2362)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nVideo duration. Adapters that declare a per-model duration map narrow\nthis to that model's union (a number, `\"8\"`, or `\"8s\"`). Use\n`adapter.snapDuration(input)` to coerce a raw value. `input` may be\nseconds, a `\"6s\"` template, or `\"auto\"` when the model lists it.\n\n***\n\n### logger\n\n```ts\nlogger: InternalLogger;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2369](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2369)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nInternal logger threaded from the generateVideo() entry point. Adapters must\ncall logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in catch blocks.\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2344](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2344)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nThe model to use for video generation\n\n***\n\n### modelOptions?\n\n```ts\noptional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2364](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2364)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nModel-specific options for video generation\n\n***\n\n### prompt\n\n```ts\nprompt: MediaPrompt;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2353](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2353)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nDescription of the desired video: a plain string, or an ordered array of\ncontent parts for image-conditioned generation. Image parts may carry\n`metadata.role` (`'start_frame' | 'end_frame' | 'reference' |\n'character'`) to disambiguate intent; adapters route them onto the\nprovider-native request (e.g. OpenAI Sora `input_reference`, fal\n`image_url` / `end_image_url`) and throw at runtime if unsupported.\n\n***\n\n### size?\n\n```ts\noptional size?: TSize;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2355](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2355)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nVideo size — format depends on the provider (e.g., \"16:9\", \"1280x720\")\n"}
